[h3]Circus Maximus[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/6fe15fbea9e256e261252645ee32c4791f71f0e0.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] +5 Happiness. All Musician's Guilds, Writer's Guilds and Painter's Guilds get +1 Production and Storage Multiplier
[b]New:[/b] +5X Happiness. All Musician's Guilds, Writer's Guilds, and Painter's Guilds gain +X Production and Storage Multipliers. X = this wonder's level
[b]Change:[/b] Circus Maximus can now be upgraded, and its bonuses scale with its level.

[h3]Colosseum[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/32ff97e037ff5cbc2bd105b11951d83458f5a1b0.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Chariot Workshops are exempt from -1 happiness. Consumes 10 chariots to produce 10 happiness. Each unlocked age gives 2 extra happiness
[b]New:[/b] Chariot Workshops are exempt from the -1 Happiness penalty. Consumes 10X Chariots to produce +5X Happiness. Each unlocked age provides an additional +X Happiness. X = this wonder's level
[b]Change:[/b] Colosseum can now be upgraded. Its Chariot consumption and Happiness bonuses scale with its level.

[h3]Statue of Zeus[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/1865444642efd8084f6847369d9850062f98c1a9.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Spawn random deposits, from among those that have been unlocked, on adjacent empty tiles. All Tier I buildings adjacent to Statue of Zeus get +5 Production and Storage Multiplier
[b]New:[/b] Spawns random unlocked deposits on adjacent empty tiles. All buildings within X tiles gain +5 Production and Storage Multipliers. X = this wonder's level
[b]Change:[/b] Statue of Zeus can now be upgraded. Its range scales with its level, and the Tier I restriction has been removed.

[h3]Parthenon[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/f079425b412fffe5669f8f91866a6402d65ba8fc.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Two great people of Classical Age are born and you get 4 choices for each. Musician's Guilds and Painter's Guilds get +1 Production, Worker Capacity and Storage Multiplier and are exempt from -1 Happiness
[b]New:[/b] Each level provides 2 Classical Age Great People, with 4 choices for each. Musician's Guilds and Painter's Guilds gain +1 Production, Worker Capacity, and Storage Multipliers and are exempt from the -1 Happiness penalty
[b]Change:[/b] Parthenon can now be upgraded, granting its Great People reward at every level.

[h3]Abu Simbel[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/9ddb0f3f1fb7e61e0edb25922133fc13d0da7260.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Double the effect of Ramesses II. All wonders Adjacent to Abu Simbel get +1 Happiness
[b]New:[/b] Each level provides +100% Ramesses II's (Great Person) effect. All wonders within X tiles gain +1 Happiness. X = this wonder's level
[b]Change:[/b] Abu Simbel can now be upgraded. Its Ramesses II bonus and Happiness range scale with its level.

[h3]Great Sphinx[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/936933f4f0d362b664ff1be0fc850c7acb451e81.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] All Tier II or above buildings within 2 tiles get +N Production Multiplier. N = Number of its adjacent buildings of the same type
[b]New:[/b] All buildings within X tiles gain +N Production Multiplier. For each affected building, N is the number of adjacent buildings of the same type. X = this wonder's level
[b]Change:[/b] Great Sphinx can now be upgraded. Its range scales with its level, and the Tier II restriction has been removed.

[h3]Opet (Egyptian Festival)[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/f2463d1f6d40a0a282deee840aea200211b2a583.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Opet: Great Sphinx provides +N Building Level Boost to all Tier II or above buildings within 2 tiles of the Sphinx. N = Number of its adjacent buildings of the same type
[b]New:[/b] Opet: Great Sphinx also grants each affected building a Building Level Boost equal to the Production Multiplier it provides
[b]Change:[/b] Opet now follows Great Sphinx's level-scaled range and expanded set of affected buildings.

[h3]Great Wall[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/8715857b934ed95ae939eb8d0a8473023f65a7d8.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] All buildings within 1 tile range get +N Production, Worker Capacity and Storage Multiplier. N = the number of the different ages between the current age and the age where the building is first unlocked. When constructed next to Forbidden City, the range increases to 2 tiles
[b]New:[/b] All buildings within X tiles gain +N Production, Worker Capacity, and Storage Multipliers. N is the difference between the current age and the age in which the building is unlocked. X = this wonder's level. Building it next to Forbidden City increases its range by 1 tile
[b]Change:[/b] Great Wall can now be upgraded. Its base range scales with its level, while Forbidden City adds 1 tile to that range.

[h3]Yellow Crane Tower[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/9d33da8089010a619ddf5aeb0ccf4afc115c3efe.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] +1 choice when choosing great people. All buildings within 1 tile range of the Tower get +1 Production, Worker Capacity and Storage Multiplier. When constructed next to Yangtze River, the range increases to 2 tiles
[b]New:[/b] Provides +1 choice when selecting Great People. All buildings within 2 tiles gain +X Production, Worker Capacity, and Storage Multipliers. X = this wonder's level. Building it next to Yangtze River increases its range by 2 tiles
[b]Change:[/b] Yellow Crane Tower can now be upgraded. Its base range is now 2 tiles, Yangtze River adds 2 tiles, and its multipliers scale with its level.

[h3]Porcelain Tower[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/9e35fdb560eb3220a5d19efcdd07bc5c4b3dfb89.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] +5 Happiness. When constructed, all your currently earned extra great people at rebirth will become available for this run (they are rolled following the same rule as permanent great people)
[b]New:[/b] +5 Happiness, plus +1 Happiness for each additional level. When constructed, all Extra Great People earned at Rebirth become available for this run, following the same roll rules as permanent Great People
[b]Change:[/b] Porcelain Tower can now be upgraded, and its Happiness bonus scales with its level. Its Great People effect is unchanged.

[h3]Lunar New Year (Chinese Festival)[/h3]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43106564/84bc4ae3e1a3da144ab1222c236ee806b748cf21.png[/img]

[b]Old:[/b] Lunar New Year: Great Wall provides double the boost to buildings. Porcelain Tower provides +1 level to all great people from this run
[b]New:[/b] Lunar New Year: Great Wall and Yellow Crane Tower also grant affected buildings a Building Level Boost equal to the Production Multiplier they provide. Porcelain Tower grants +1 level to all Great People from this run
[b]Change:[/b] Great Wall's doubled multipliers have been replaced with an equivalent Building Level Boost, and Yellow Crane Tower now also grants a Building Level Boost during Lunar New Year. Porcelain Tower's festival bonus is unchanged.
